      "instance_name": "holocaust",
      "label": "The Holocaust",
      "description": "The systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. This historical event is central to understanding the gravity of the meme's context and the offense it causes by trivializing genocide.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
