      "instance_name": "antisemitism",
      "label": "Antisemitism",
      "description": "A long-standing prejudice against Jewish people, often manifesting in stereotypes, discrimination, and hate. The meme relies on antisemitic tropes to create its offensive content, including the 'blood libel' and 'puppet master' imagery, which are part of the broader antisemitic framework.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
