      "label": "Holocaust denial or minimization themes",
      "description": "The act of denying, downplaying, or trivializing the Holocaust. The meme's dark humor and crude joke about 'cooking time' directly engage in minimizing the horror of the Holocaust, which is a form of Holocaust denial/minimization.",
